---
description: >-
  Agentflow edge labels as tags inside coloured flows (D628): the label inside
  the styled flow and the one inside the palette-coloured flow keep the theme
  background as their fill.
config:
  theme: redux-color
---
agentflow-beta LR
  flow styled["Styled"]
    a["Plan"]
    b["Act"]
  end
  flow palette["Palette"]
    c["Check"]
    d["Report"]
  end
  a -->|inside| b
  c -->|also inside| d
  b -->|outside| c
  style styled fill:#fde68a,stroke:#b45309
